  "docs": {
    "readme": "README.md",
    "extra": [],
    "summary": "TPT Court Open-source court ERP platform for judges, lawyers, clerks, and the public. Manage cases, documents, hearings, and payments with ease. Architecture tpt-court/ \u251c\u2500\u2500 apps/ \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 api/          # Fastify REST API + Socket.io \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 web/          # Next.js 15 web application \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 desktop/      # Electron desktop wrapper \u251c\u2500\u2500 packages/ \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 database/     # Prisma ORM, schema, seed \u2502   \u251c\u2500\u2500 types/        # Shared TypeScript types \u2502   \u2514\u2500\u2500 ui/           # Shared UI components (React + Tailwind)"
  },
